<title>SPAIN: Reuters 6th ex-Madrid air cargo market report.</title>
<headline>Reuters 6th ex-Madrid air cargo market report.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current average ex- Madrid Spanish peseta air cargo rates per kg for a 100 kg shipment with a volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-one.</p>
<p>			   Jan 21	 Dec 17</p>
<p>		    NORTH AMERICA</p>
<p> MAD-JFK		 170	    160</p>
<p> MAD-CHI		 195	    180</p>
<p> MAD-MIA		 190	    195</p>
<p> MAD-LAX		 230	    215</p>
<p>		    LATIN AMERICA</p>
<p> MAD-MEX		 285	    280</p>
<p> MAD-BUE		 435	    440</p>
<p> MAD-RIO		 400	    400</p>
<p>		    MIDDLE EAST</p>
<p> MAD-DXB		 250	    235</p>
<p>		    FAR EAST</p>
<p> MAD-HKG		 240	    255</p>
<p> MAD-TYO		 360	    365</p>
<p>These rates were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, general sales agents (GSAs) and freight forwarders.</p>
<p>* All prices quoted in Spanish pesetas.</p>
<p>* The tariffs represent average market rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative of current market activity. -Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax:5017</p>
</text>
